","text":"皆様、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"保存今の内よ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/17/8743039/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15枚目ラストの握手会は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイドりなりなが来たよっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回萌え萌えきゅんしたんだろ。、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、りなりな出現するからね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/17/8743039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこに出るかわかんないからね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出会えた人はラッキーだねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/17/8743039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご主人様？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこにりなりな当たるかドキドキしながら会いに来てくださいね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りなりなずっとお待ちしております"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/17/8743039/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"。。。。。5年も経てば、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人は、なんでも出来るようになるんだな笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、ベストヒット歌謡祭見てくださってありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/17/8743039/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/11/17/8743039/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まゆゆさんに会えたよ〜(*´꒳`*)♡♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真集サイン入りの頂きました♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはり、まゆゆさんは天使"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/im